      "footer_refs": [
        "Breyer, B. (2015). Soziales Vertrauen [Social Trust Scale]. Zusammenstellung sozialwissenschaftlicher Items und Skalen (ZIS). https://doi.org/10.6102/zis235",
        "Items from: European Social Survey Round 5 (2010/2011). https://ess.sikt.no/en/study/412db4fe-c77a-4e98-8ea4-6c19007f551b",
        "Scoring: mean of three 0–10 items (ppltrst, pplfair, pplhlp). Higher = greater generalized social trust."
      ]
